# PismoPorts archive sites.
#
# Two stanzas, and BOTH are required. Getting this wrong fails silently --
# MacPorts prints nothing at normal verbosity, quietly ignores the site, and
# compiles from source instead. That cost days of this project: the build farm
# recompiled gettext on six builders, harfbuzz for thirty hours and cmake on
# four builders for six hours each, every one of them with a byte-identical
# archive already sitting on the host.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. The bare "macports_archives" entry.
#
# A name with no urls SHADOWS the same-named site that the ports tree defines
# in port1.0/fetch/archive_sites.tcl. Without it, every archivefetch goes to
# packages.macports.org first, which has nothing built for darwin 8 powerpc,
# so each lookup costs a 30-second timeout before falling back to a source
# build. Do not add urls to this entry -- that re-enables the default.
name                    macports_archives

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Our own site, with EVERY field populated.
#
# portarchivefetch::filter_sites drops any site missing archive_type,
# archive_prefix, archive_frameworks_dir, archive_applications_dir,
# archive_cxx_stdlib or archive_delete_la_files. It says so only via ui_warn,
# which is invisible unless you run with -d. An entry with just name and urls
# looks perfectly reasonable and is never used.
#
# The three paths are compared against this installation's own values after
# realpath, so they must match exactly. On darwin 8 the defaults are
# cxx_stdlib libstdc++ (libc++ starts at darwin 10) and delete_la_files no
# (la-file deletion starts at darwin 13).
#
# Archives here are signed with the PismoPorts key; the matching public key
# must be listed in pubkeys.conf or every fetch is discarded after download.
# There is no way to skip that check -- ${portdbpath}/incoming/verified is the
# only path that bypasses signature verification, which is what its name means.
name                    pismoports
urls                    https://degnanresearch.com/pismoports/
type                    tbz2
prefix                  /opt/local
applications_dir        /Applications/MacPorts
frameworks_dir          /opt/local/Library/Frameworks
cxx_stdlib              libstdc++
delete_la_files         no
